# Example: exposing typed Python functions to Inimerse (roadmap §3.3).
#
# Pipeline:
#   1. Scan a typed Python module:  python3 tools/python_scan.py pymod.py --emit-idl pymod.def
#      (untyped / async / decorated functions are reported as manual points)
#   2. Generate bindings:           python3 tools/bindgen.py pymod.def --language python
#      or scan the module for the migration report:
#      python3 tools/migrate_report.py pymod.py -o report.md
#   3. Untyped dynamic parts are NEVER silently wrapped.
say "see tools/python_scan.py --help and tools/migrate_report.py"
